# uv — apps/api/uv.lock is COMMITTED (per Astral's recommended pattern for
# applications, not libraries). apps/api/Dockerfile does `COPY apps/api/uv.lock`
# during the api image build, so the file must be in the build context. Any
# other uv.lock file (root, other workspaces) is ignored as an orphan.
uv.lock
!apps/api/uv.lock

