# opencode harness support for AI-DLC (generated mirror + vendored deps).
# Regenerated by scripts/aidlc-switch-harness.sh from the AIDLC runtime at
# ~/.local/share/aidlc/versions/<runtime>/runtime/opencode/. Do NOT commit
# vendor code: any divergence from upstream is lost on the next refresh, and
# upstream code may fail the project's GGA gate.
.aidlc/
.opencode/
opencode.json

